===Etymology===
From the character {{w|Caspar Milquetoast}} of the comic strip ''The Timid Soul'', created by American cartoonist [[w:H. T. Webster|Harold Tucker Webster]] (1885–1952) and first published in 1924; the character was named after the American dish {{m|en|milk toast|t=a food consisting of toasted bread in warm milk}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|entry=Milquetoast|pos=n|id=118610|date=March 2002|nodot=yes}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>

